{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/aa55daf9e7c34e414c9d2aff5e4ea96e.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up you Craft, a shop in a corner of the royal capital and start hammering away! Craft swords, bows, shields, and armor, then proudly display them on your shelves. Adventurers from all walks of life will come scratching at your door, and their success (and nine lives) depend on your craftsmanship. As your fame grows, more paws will visit, and your Craft will grow bigger and busier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.poster.avif?t=1767681046\" width=778 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.webm?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.mp4?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/0e51a4b57353e6b493a822c27d68c5e2.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clang and spark levels up your skills. Study blueprints, forge stronger weapons, and keep up with adventurers\u2019 ever-rising needs. Slot magical gems found in the deepest dungeons into your creations to give them claws of pure power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/73601d5cd18e59d71a4edd9b908f77ca.avif?t=1767681046\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/4d2ca4186c240effc101f0cfcddc9a81.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cat can do it all alone! Hire apprentices with unique talents to help you hammer, sell, research, and dismantle gear. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/5c1bda359b8e6739764c2d33b2ca338e.poster.avif?t=1767681046\" width=778 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/5c1bda359b8e6739764c2d33b2ca338e.webm?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/5c1bda359b8e6739764c2d33b2ca338e.mp4?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your workshop, add new anvils and shelves, and make sure every adventurer leaves purring with satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/d2f0b01a21f3f87378b6eb184a8486a5.poster.avif?t=1767681046\" width=778 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/d2f0b01a21f3f87378b6eb184a8486a5.webm?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/d2f0b01a21f3f87378b6eb184a8486a5.mp4?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/dc42bd0429c29c699b02406d4b05b527.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky mercenaries, wide-eyed explorers, powerful mages, and even bards who sing of heroes and claws of glory. Forge gear to keep them safe from dungeon monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/9f96f4c7cbd35b57d4f7136ff0f10e49.poster.avif?t=1767681046\" width=778 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/9f96f4c7cbd35b57d4f7136ff0f10e49.webm?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/9f96f4c7cbd35b57d4f7136ff0f10e49.mp4?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/63f77ccb7d42ab83dc214634d8f0b33e.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can\u2019t wield a sword yourself? No problem! Form adventurer parties to explore dangerous dungeons for rare loot. Post quests at the Adventurer Guild, gather clues about the Demon Dragon\u2019s lair, and piece together the path to your final showdown.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481810?t=1767681046","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2481810?t=1767681046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/5b0f1cd8005c8cba62818beeb51dc8bc3eb90bdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767681046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/5b0f1cd8005c8cba62818beeb51dc8bc3eb90bdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767681046","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udd25 Join the Playtest Now!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome, future Master Blacksmith! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exclusive Playtest, you'll dive into the charming chaos of your very own smithy. It's time to roll up your sleeves (or paws!):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Paw-some Helpers:</strong> Hire a team of adorable, yet capable, animal assistants to manage the fires and forge the finest gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Your Empire:</strong> Earn those precious Fishcoins from satisfied adventurers and invest them to transform your cozy shop into a thriving industrial hub.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip the Guild:</strong> Craft legendary gear and watch the adventurers from the Guild depend on your skills before they brave the depths of the Dungeon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the start! Your feedback is the catalyst for the full release, which will unlock a wealth of new features: intricate forge blueprints, powerful equipment enhancement techniques, and thrilling late-game content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join the test and help us hammer out the perfect game!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/aa55daf9e7c34e414c9d2aff5e4ea96e.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up you Craft, a shop in a corner of the royal capital and start hammering away! Craft swords, bows, shields, and armor, then proudly display them on your shelves. Adventurers from all walks of life will come scratching at your door, and their success (and nine lives) depend on your craftsmanship. As your fame grows, more paws will visit, and your Craft will grow bigger and busier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.poster.avif?t=1767681046\" width=778 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.webm?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/f886730916e4638ea0cee84d8328799f.mp4?t=1767681046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/0e51a4b57353e6b493a822c27d68c5e2.avif?t=1767681046\" width=800 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clang and spark levels up your skills. Study blueprints, forge stronger weapons, and keep up with adventurers\u2019 ever-rising needs. Slot magical gems found in the deepest dungeons into your creations to give them claws of pure power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2481810/extras/73601d5cd18e59d71a4edd9b908f77ca.avif?t=1767681046\" width=1560 height=746 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ct